/# gemini 2.5 pro

# Role
You are an expert on prompting text-to-image and text-to-video model.

# Task
Write a prompt for generate the first frame for this storyboard scene.
A good prompt must consist of these parts: subject description, setting, layout, lighting, visual style.
The image should be relatively concise, LESS THAN 3 main subjects.
If the scene needs animatic for long-range coherence, subject identity inconsistency or avoid other video generation defects, you can generate at most 3 key frame images.

# Prompt example
A young woman with long blonde hair, wearing a white t-shirt and blue jeans, walking through a sunny park with green trees in the background, carrying a brown shoulder bag.

# Visual style
采用坚韧的写实主义风格，战斗场景色调偏冷、饱和度低，但在关键的牺牲时刻运用风格化的英雄光影以增强情感冲击力。

# Ref image
The character and setting image is uploaded to the text-to-image model. You can ref them by mentioning their filenames, the character file is named as 'character-`character_id`'; the setting file is named as 'setting-`setting_id`'.
The setting image is always full view. The character is always full body portrait. Prompt to use part of the ref image if necessary.

# Story logline
1941年，为掩护主力部队和当地群众安全转移，五名八路军战士在狼牙山与数千日军周旋，最终在弹尽粮绝之际，他们选择英勇跳崖，用生命谱写了一曲壮丽的英雄赞歌。

# Setting description
{
    "id": 2,
    "name": "狼牙山山路/山崖",
    "description": "崎岖、陡峭的山路，布满荆棘和嶙峋的岩石。环境险恶，色调以灰、褐色为主，光线被山体遮挡，明暗对比强烈，营造出压迫感。"
}

# Character description
{
    "id": 1,
    "name": "马宝玉",
    "description": "六班班长，约二十多岁，沉着冷静，眼神坚定。身着略显陈旧但整洁的八路军军装，作为指挥员，决策果断，是队伍的核心。"
}

{
    "id": 2,
    "name": "葛振林",
    "description": "副班长，年龄稍长，经验丰富，面容坚毅，刻有风霜的痕迹。性格稳重，观察力敏锐，是马宝玉的得力助手。"
}

# Scene
      {
        "panel_id": 1,
        "voiceover_ref": "1.1",
        "setting_id": 4,
        "character_ids": [],
        "panel_description": "档案影片风格的黑白画面。一队日本士兵在崎岖的山路上行军，背景是荒凉的山脉。画面有颗粒感。",
        "action": "日本士兵表情麻木地向前行进，军官在旁呵斥。",
        "shot_type": "Wide Shot",
        "camera_movement": "Static",
        "duration_sec": 7,
        "is_continue": false
      }

# Output Format
Your final output must be a single, valid JSON object. Structure the JSON according to this schema.
```json
{
    "thought": "Your thinking or other necessary information.",
    "prompt": "The final prompt for image generation.",
    "keyframe_prompt": [
        "Optional. An array of prompts for keyframes image generation"
    ]
}
```